.TH HOLO-SCREENSHOT-PORTAL 1 "October 2026" "holo 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
holo-screenshot-portal \- copy a screenshot to the clipboard via the desktop portal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B holo-screenshot-portal
.RB [ \-\-interactive ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Takes a screenshot through the XDG desktop portal, copies it to the
clipboard, and deletes the temporary file. With
.B \-\-interactive
the desktop's own area and window picker opens. Used by
.BR holo (1)
for the screenshot actions when gnome-screenshot is not installed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR holo (1)
